1
00:00:00,973 --> 00:00:02,473
(Sheldon:)Un-unravelable.

2
00:00:07,521 --> 00:00:10,311
(Leonard(opening door):)Oh, hey, Penny. Wow, look at you,
all ready for your showcase.

3
00:00:10,482 --> 00:00:11,982
(Leonard(opening door):)- You look great.
PENNY: Thanks.

4
00:00:12,151 --> 00:00:16,321
(Penny:)I just wanted to come by and wish you
guys luck with your symposium.

5
00:00:17,072 --> 00:00:18,362
LEONARD:
Oh.

6
00:00:18,532 --> 00:00:20,992
- Well, thank you.
- You know, I gotta tell you.

7
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:24,370
(Penny:)A lot of friends would let their friend
go alone, but that's not you.

8
00:00:24,538 --> 00:00:28,248
(Penny:)You are the kind of guy
who stands by a friend when...

9
00:00:28,417 --> 00:00:31,337
(Penny:)When he has a symposium to go to.

10
00:00:34,465 --> 00:00:36,715
(Leonard:)I don't know what to say.

11
00:00:37,426 --> 00:00:40,806
- It's okay, Leonard.
- Oh, okay, all right, good.

12
00:00:41,639 --> 00:00:43,139
- Oh, boy, group hug.
- Uh-uh.

13
00:00:43,307 --> 00:00:47,267
- Uh-uh?
- Okay. So, what's up?

14
00:00:47,436 --> 00:00:51,566
Well, Penny is on her way to perform in
a one-night showcase production of Rent...

15
00:00:51,732 --> 00:00:55,022
(Sheldon:)...which we are unable to attend,
because we're going to a symposium...

16
00:00:55,194 --> 00:00:59,574
(Leonard:)...on molecular positronium
given by Dr. Emil Farmanfarmian.

